WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.920
Someone once said...

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:56.790
There are hermit crabs that live 
in thick avocados... Avocrabos!

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:04.400
Fruit grows on the crispy karinto 
tree that is sweet and aromatic...

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:08.270
Karintapples!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:11.440
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.140
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:21.620
As part of Toriko's training, Ichiryu 
asked him to get Mellow Cola,

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:25.420
found in the Gourmet Pyramid, also 
known as the Gourmet Hunter Tomb.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.120
Thinking that he needed the help

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:32.130
of another of the Four Kings, 
Zebra, to obtain the Mellow Cola,

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.630
Toriko, along with Komatsu, 
set off for Honey Prison,

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:37.660
where Zebra was a prisoner.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.470
At Honey Prison, home to only 
the most heinous criminals,

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.340
Toriko was reunited with Zebra.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:51.540
Looks like the world's pretty 
boring without me around.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:58.020
Unleashed Roar! Death Row Zebra's Release!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:12.530
This is ill-omened! Many lives will be taken!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:24.080
Tina has safely made it home from 
a voyage on the Gourmet Carriage!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.510
And I bought a heaping 
helping... of souvenirs...

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:32.650
Tina!

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.580
Move it!

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:40.290
This is no time for going on a trip!

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.630
Tina! Get to the studio!

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.260
Hurry up!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.430
We're interrupting the regularly scheduled 
programming with a news bulletin.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.200
According to a report that just came in,

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:56.270
one of the Four Kings, Zebra, has 
just been released from prison...

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.040
Really?!

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:03.980
Due to the news of Zebra's 
release, stocks hit a limit low.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:07.850
The price of ingredients has skyrocketed 
to over ten times the norm!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:13.920
And 25 countries have declared a state 
of emergency in preparation for Zebra.

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:18.760
We have economic expert Manet-san 
with us in the studio.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.630
Gourmet University Economics 
Department Head Manet

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.860
If the news of Zebra's release is true,

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:25.940
the economic losses of the entire world 
will be thousands of trillions of yen.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:31.270
And the damage will be so great that over 
ten developed nations could collapse.

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.310
For real?!

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:34.610
For real.

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.210
Chief! Chief Love!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.880
The news about Zebra has already been leaked!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.590
So much for "top secret"...

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.990
But I'm not going to just let Zebra-chan's 
release be a special case.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:52.160
Don't tell me there are 
conditions that reflect

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.860
your personal feelings towards Zebra...

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:58.330
No! An old woman's love is pure!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.900
Sorry to keep you waiting! 
This is everything!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.340
It's finally ready!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:09.410
Honestly! Who ever heard of a celebration 
at a prison for an inmate's release?!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:12.710
I'll be sure to bill you for 
all the expenses, Toriko-chan.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.950
Bill Zebra himself! Although 
he'll probably complain

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:19.490
that this is a meager excuse 
for a release celebration.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.560
How much does he eat?!

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:23.860
So... where is the man of the hour?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.790
With the prisoners.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.730
You mean he's going to 
say goodbye to everyone?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:35.400
Huh... I thought he looked scary, but 
he's actually a nice, courteous guy.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:38.570
Not quite. See, Zebra's 
way of saying goodbye is

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:42.210
visiting the prisoners who complained 
about him behind his back...

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.610
That's totally different...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:50.450
He's got sharp ears like 
you wouldn't believe.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.920
Also, Zebra-chan is said to have the 
shortest temper of the Four Kings,

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.390
and he's quick to fight.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.790
So don't just stand there, go and stop him.

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:03.660
I don't know of any creature 
that's more warlike than he is.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:20.210
That's because there ain't anything more 
stimulating in this world than battle.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:24.750
Don't make a fuss, kid... or I'll eat ya!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.650
Cut it out.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:32.860
Don't even think about laying 
a hand on my partner, punk.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:36.760
Whose head do you think you're grabbin'?

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.930
Your hair's gotten a lot longer.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:43.400
Hey, hey... You'd better not 
mess around with me too much.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.210
I came all the way here 
to get you, so play nice.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.770
Don't think so.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:54.810
But if you don't mind, how about helpin' 
me blow off a little stress, Toriko?

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:58.250
Come on. Let's scrap.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.150
W-Wait...

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:06.520
I'm jealous. They're so 
close that they fight.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.460
Tranquilizing Pheromones!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:21.240
Now, make up with each 
other so we can all eat.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:28.510
Shoot! Why doesn't it 
work on you, Zebra-chan?!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.610
Why doesn't what work?

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.080
My pheromones!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:33.080
What is that? Somethin' you can eat?

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:35.320
Hey, Zebra!

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.050
Let's eat!

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.260
Alright, we'll put our fight off 'til later.

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:41.720
I'm not gonna fight!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:48.360
I give thanks for this world's bounty.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.730
Thank you!

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:53.800
So you have to capture 500 wanted criminals

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.440
and discover 100 new types of ingredients!

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:58.640
Those are the conditions of your release.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.440
Hey, this is <i>my</i> release celebration.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.680
Got it?!

00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:03.280
Don't get carried away 
and wolf everything down.

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:06.850
They're also the orders of the president!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.380
By the way, Toriko...

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.080
What?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:12.290
What the hell is that Mellow Cola?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.950
Listen to me, Zebra-chan!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.460
According to the old man, it's the 
most delicious cola in the world.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:16.460
It's no use...

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:20.860
You like cola, don't you? Drinking 
it will be worth your while.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:24.570
Cola?! What am I, a little brat?!

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:28.140
You're drooling all over the place.

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:30.000
Did you hear what I said?!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.540
The capture of 500 wanted criminals and 
the discovery of 100 new ingredients!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:40.410
All that food I made... gone in an instant.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:46.820
So this is Zebra-san... Incarcerated 
for having this appetite...

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:51.960
But is eating too much really a crime 
that can get you the death penalty?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:54.390
Hey, kid.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.430
Is it true you're the own who made this food?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.570
Th-That's right. I hope you don't mind

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.100
that I took the liberty 
of cooking for everyone.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:05.770
Did it suit your taste?

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:09.010
Now that you mention it...

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:12.610
Komatsu... We're almost at Honey Prison.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:13.810
R-Right!

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:16.080
Oh, that's right. Cook something up

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:19.220
for Zebra's release 
celebration at the prison.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:22.090
At the prison?

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:26.290
Th-That's right. He's one of your 
dear friends, huh, Toriko-san?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.090
I'll treat him to the best of my ability.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.300
What does Zebra-san like?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.630
Don't worry. That guy eats everything.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:39.200
Please tell me! I need to think up the menu!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.970
Hmm... Well, if you insist, I guess meat...

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.540
I have to think of a nutritious balance, too.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.380
Should I give it a richer taste?

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:53.850
Or maybe an unusual taste that you 
can't get in prison would be better...

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:56.750
I hope Zebra-san will be pleased...

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:02.290
...is what you were sayin', right, kid?!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:02.730
Right!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.960
Don't get cocky!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.060
R-R-Right!

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:11.940
I hate cocky bastards more than anything!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:18.240
When I look at 'em, I just wanna crush 
'em into pulp, every last one of 'em!

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:23.910
Um... S-Sorry I got cocky there...

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.780
So you <i>were</i> gettin' cocky then?!

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:31.520
No, I wasn't! Not at all!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:31.890
Chief!

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.460
What's wrong, Oban?

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.590
The Forest Goblin has appeared.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.900
Oh? That's a pain.

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:48.640
Forest Goblin? That's what Oban-san 
mentioned at the entrance. But what is it?

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:53.040
It's a turtle that awakens once 
a year, during Monster Season.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.610
Turtle? Monster Season?

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:01.650
The Death Season Forest is around here.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:05.350
It's a harsh environment that 
rivals the Gourmet World itself.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:09.560
And it has four seasons: Magma, 
Mist, Freeze, and Monster.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:15.430
Magma Season

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:15.160
In Magma Season, lava erupts everywhere.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:21.270
Mist Season

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:21.270
In Mist Season, the forest is 
enveloped in a poisonous mist.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:27.180
Freeze Season

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:27.480
In Freeze Season, a blizzard 
freezes everything.

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:34.180
Monster Season

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:34.220
And now it's Monster Season, in 
which ferocious Beasts awaken.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:38.290
The average Capture Level 
of these Beasts is 60.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:40.090
60?!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:46.030
And the strongest among them is the 
turtle that's called the Forest Goblin,

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.460
also known as a Magma Tortoise.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:51.930
Wouldn't it be better to wait 'til the 
season is over before we release Zebra?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:55.700
Certainly, it is dangerous...

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.310
Gettin' cocky, is he?!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:31.340
What are all these Beasts?!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:35.610
It's the beginning of this season 
in the Death Season Forest.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.710
We can't go outside unprepared.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:42.110
There's the Magma Tortoise.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:08.670
Magma Tortoise (Amphibious 
Beast) Capture Level 70

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.440
That's the Magma Tortoise?!

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:12.040
Zebra-san went outside by himself,

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:14.980
but is he going to be okay 
when it's this dangerous?!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.850
Dangerous? Come to think of it, there's 
one thing I forgot to tell you.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:20.820
The crime that Zebra committed...

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:29.690
I see. This guy's cocky as hell.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.760
Zebra's hearing is so sharp,

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:35.330
he can catch the sound of a coin dropping 
from dozens of kilometers away.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:38.370
He also has the power to manipulate his voice

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.640
and can use its vibrations 
to destroy everything.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:46.940
Was it the power of Zebra-san's voice 
that destroyed the execution grounds?

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.780
Yeah. When it comes to power 
and destructive capability,

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:52.280
Sunny, Coco, and I don't 
hold a candle to him.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.460
The problem is his appetite 
and readiness to fight.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:17.140
Cover your ears, Komatsu!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:54.440
Whether it's prey that he likes 
or people that tick him off,

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.150
he'll devour them to extinction.

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:58.650
Extinction?!

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:02.020
He's made 26 species of creatures 
go extinct up to now.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.590
That's Zebra's heinous crime.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.350
And that's why he's been designated

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:09.490
a first-class dangerous 
creature himself, even now.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.830
Of all the monsters that 
are outside right now,

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.400
the most dangerous one is none other than...

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:17.930
...Zebra.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.840
Amplify the reverberation from inside.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:33.080
Now, come down... Thunderbolt of sound!

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:40.090
Thunder Noise!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:14.650
Crap!

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:19.260
Noise Missile!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.070
H-He...

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.710
What destructive power!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.180
All those Capture Level 60 Beasts 
wiped out in an instant...

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:15.180
He really has gotten stronger.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:25.120
That took a lot out of 
me. Now I lost my voice.

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:26.360
Zebra...

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:34.160
Toriko, after I eat these guys, 
I'll wanna moisten my throat a bit.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.930
Then how about goin' to drink some cola?!

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:44.610
Was it really a good idea to release Zebra?

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:50.280
Don't worry! It'll be fine. 
Zebra-chan will come back to me.

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.950
It's that thing where he'll realize

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:55.720
how much I really mean to 
him once we're separated.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:18:00.090
Th-That's not what I'm worried about...

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:03.530
I was wondering whether releasing someone

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.030
with that much power was a wise decision...

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:11.070
The president took into consideration 
how powerful Zebra-chan is,

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.400
and still granted his release.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:17.100
That goes to show how tough 
it is to get Mellow Cola.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.840
Zebra-chan and Toriko-chan...

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:22.940
The road ahead might be 
rough for those two...

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:24.610
After all...

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:28.980
...they'll have to get through 
the Labyrinth of the Red Desert.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:32.950
The Labyrinth of the Red Desert... Yes...

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:41.730
I wonder where Zebra-chan is right now...

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:04.120
Beautiful! A sand rainbow!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.690
The view from a Lift House sure is unique.

00:19:08.550 --> 00:19:11.320
A Lift House is the only way 
to get to the Sand Garden

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:13.890
where the Gourmet Pyramid is located.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:17.800
It's a one month trip to 
get across the giant lift.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:23.940
But it seems like we're the 
only ones using a Lift House...

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:27.170
And a lot of the houses are all beat up...

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:28.540
Kid!

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:31.180
I'm starvin'!

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:37.520
Right! I'll make something! 
Right now! Over there!

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.600
Cooped up in here for one month with him...

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.840
Whether it's prey that he likes 
or people that tick him off,

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:07.680
he'll devour them to extinction.

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.010
Extinction...

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.750
He's made 26 species of creatures 
go extinct up to now.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.820
That's Zebra's heinous crime.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:22.990
Ain't that my booze you've got?!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.160
You lookin' for a fight, Toriko?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.660
You're the one that's tryin' to start one!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:29.900
I'm happy.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:30.830
About what?!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:35.540
That there's a guy here who I 
can brawl with on equal terms!

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:33.640
Toriko-san, are you sure about this?

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.440
I mean, traveling with him...

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:39.210
Come on!

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:51.110
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:54.210
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:54.510 --> 00:21:56.420
Our guest today is Tom-san.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:22:00.920
Tom-san, right off the bat, 
do you have a scoop for us?

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:04.290
Sure! Let me show everyone the 
King Crab that you can get

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:08.490
for a special price today for a certain 
reason only at the Gourmet Market!

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:12.970
This isn't that kind of show!

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:15.940
Normally, this King Crab 
sells for eight million yen,

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:19.010
but you can get it today... 
for only four million yen!

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:22.370
That's 50% off, a four million yen saving!

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:25.440
Look, I'm telling you, 
this isn't that kind of...

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:29.550
And if you act now, I'll throw in 
a free King Crab on top of that!

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:34.720
Is that a fantastic deal?! 
Still, four million yen...

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:38.860
It's so huge, I don't think I'd be able 
to get it through my front door...

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:40.930
But you said "for a certain reason"?!

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:43.500
Together, those two are 
called the "Love Crabs".

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:46.570
They're a crab couple that 
live together and are in love!

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:51.740
Trying to separate them is dangerous, as 
they get violent if you even get close!

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:58.310
This is exactly what I'm talking about,

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:02.080
so shipping and handling will cost 
the special price of ten million yen!

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:02.950
Expensive!

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:04.880
Next! Let's go to the next segment!

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.720
The super-short tempered problem child.

00:23:09.020 --> 00:23:12.400
What did Komatsu see in the desert to cause his suspicion?

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:13.790
A vision of death? Or maybe...

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:17.390
Warning! Zebra Has Disembarked at the Sand Garden!

00:23:17.610 --> 00:23:19.240
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
